# fixture for the per-material texture specs (#1573)
# four single-triangle material groups, laid out so the resolved draw
# ranges exercise merging (alpha + beta share a map), switching (gamma),
# and the mesh-texture fallback (plain declares no map_Kd)
mtllib multitex.mtl
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 0 1 0
v 2 0 0
v 3 0 0
v 2 1 0
v 4 0 0
v 5 0 0
v 4 1 0
v 6 0 0
v 7 0 0
v 6 1 0
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 0 1
usemtl alpha
f 1/1 2/2 3/3
usemtl beta
f 4/1 5/2 6/3
usemtl gamma
f 7/1 8/2 9/3
usemtl plain
f 10/1 11/2 12/3
